{
  "id": "note-from-the-author",
  "kind": "introduction",
  "sourceKind": "author-note",
  "label": "Author's Note",
  "title": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "shortTitle": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "sourceRange": [
    53,
    104
  ],
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "title": 53
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lalit R. Mishra",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 54,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If you are reading this…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 55
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you are already inside something you usually avoid noticing."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 56
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not the book."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 57
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not the words."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 58
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But the act of being aware right now."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 59
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book was never written to give you answers."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because answers are where most journeys quietly stop."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 61
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It was written to disturb something very normal inside you:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 62
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "the automatic need to explain everything you experience."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 63
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You don’t notice it usually."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 64
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But your mind is constantly doing something in the background:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 65
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "turning moments into meaning,"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 66
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "feelings into labels,"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 67
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "thoughts into identity,"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 68
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and identity into a story called “me”."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 69
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And slowly, without permission…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 70
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "that story becomes your entire world."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 71
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book is not here to replace that story with a better one."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 72
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is here to show you that the story was never solid to begin with."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 73
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So as you read, something might feel uncomfortable."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 74
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because something is wrong…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 75
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but because something familiar is becoming less convincing."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 76
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Let it be."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 77
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Don’t rush to fix it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 78
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Don’t rush to understand it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 79
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Even understanding is part of the same movement."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is no final point here."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 81
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No hidden conclusion."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 82
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No correct interpretation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 83
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Just this simple possibility:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 84
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "what you call “my thoughts”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 85
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "might just be thoughts happening"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 86
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": " what you call “my reactions”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 87
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": " might just be reactions happening"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 88
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": " what you call “my self”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 89
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": " might just be a process unfolding"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 90
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And if that feels too simple to be true…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 91
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "notice that too."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 92
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because this book is not trying to change your mind."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 93
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is quietly pointing out that the mind is already changing on its own."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 94
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So don’t try to hold onto anything from here."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 95
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not ideas."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 96
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not insights."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 97
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not states."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 98
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not clarity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 99
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Even this note is not something to carry."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is something to pass through."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 101
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And if something remains after all of this…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 102
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "it will not be an answer."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 103
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It will be the absence of urgency to find one."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 104
    }
  ],
  "suppressHeaderNumber": true,
  "index": 5,
  "file": "chapters/05-note-from-the-author.json"
}
